# Tinker's additional cost (CR 118.8, 601.2b) is a sacrifice of an artifact, chosen once the mana is paid and paid with
# it: Black Lotus pays {2}{U} and is sacrificed doing so, so Mox Sapphire is the only artifact left to sacrifice, and
# the question is asked all the same. The artifact Tinker finds (Mox Ruby) is put onto the battlefield as it resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Tinker
Island
Island x3
Mox Ruby
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Tinker.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Mox Sapphire)
Bot1.Search(Mox Ruby)

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Ruby
Bot1.Graveyard = Tinker; Mox Sapphire; Black Lotus
